---
// UUIDv7 figure: the 128-bit layout, field widths to scale (RFC 9562, section 5.7).
---

<figure>
	<svg viewBox="0 0 720 150" role="img" aria-labelledby="lay-t lay-d">
		<title id="lay-t">UUIDv7 bit layout</title>
		<desc id="lay-d">A 128-bit bar drawn to scale: 48 bits unix timestamp in milliseconds, 4 bits version, 12 bits rand_a, 2 bits variant, 62 bits rand_b.</desc>
		<g font-size="13" text-anchor="middle">
			<rect x="10" y="20" width="262.5" height="52" fill="#c4c4c4"></rect>
			<text x="141" y="44" fill="#09090b">unix_ts_ms</text>
			<text x="141" y="62" fill="#09090b">48 bits</text>
			<rect x="272.5" y="20" width="21.875" height="52" fill="#fff"></rect>
			<rect x="294.375" y="20" width="65.625" height="52" fill="#383838"></rect>
			<text x="327" y="44" fill="#fff">rand_a</text>
			<text x="327" y="62" fill="#fff">12</text>
			<rect x="360" y="20" width="10.9375" height="52" fill="#fff"></rect>
			<rect x="370.9375" y="20" width="339.0625" height="52" fill="#383838"></rect>
			<text x="540" y="44" fill="#fff">rand_b</text>
			<text x="540" y="62" fill="#fff">62 bits</text>
			<text x="283" y="96" fill="#8d8d8d" font-size="11">ver (4)</text>
			<text x="365" y="120" fill="#8d8d8d" font-size="11">var (2)</text>
			<text x="10" y="142" fill="#8d8d8d" font-size="11" text-anchor="start">bit 0</text>
			<text x="272.5" y="142" fill="#8d8d8d" font-size="11">48</text>
			<text x="710" y="142" fill="#8d8d8d" font-size="11" text-anchor="end">127</text>
		</g>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>Field widths are drawn to scale. Layout from RFC 9562, section 5.7.</figcaption>
</figure>
